{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and Marco's First Argument", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "You'd Better", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Around the World > Jazzing it up in Montreal", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Offering Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Giving advice in English might seem tricky at first. To talk about what is advisable (what you think should be done), we use <span class=\"strong\">had better</span>, <span class=\"strong\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"strong\">might want to</span>. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "These phrases come before the verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Subject + had better + verb</span>: You'd better take that back!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Subject + ought to + verb</span>: You ought to think before you speak, you know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Subject + might want to + verb</span>: You might want to hear yourself.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "touchy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "easily upset; emotionally sensitive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're so touchy today - take it easy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about people's habits.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "perfectly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a perfect way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm being perfectly calm.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "reasonable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "logical; sensible", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm being perfectly reasonable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "recklessly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "dangerously; without care", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are behaving recklessly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to accuse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to formally say someone did something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You recklessly accuse me of being insensitive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cleverly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in a smart way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You cleverly got out of that argument.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sewing machine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a machine used for making clothes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's my antique sewing machine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sewing room", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a room used for making clothes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Shouldn't your sewing machine be in your sewing room?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Used to</span> and<span class=\"strong\"> Would</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about regular events in the past, you can use <span class=\"strong\">used to</span> or <span class=\"strong\">would</span>. These are alternative forms from  the Simple Past + Adverbs of frequency.<br/><span class=\"italic\">My grandmother used to like sewing. She would sew for hours.</span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Used to</span> is used for actions (study, work, talk, read, etc.) and for states, or permanent events in the past  (be, have, like, think).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Would</span> is used for actions only. We never use it to talk about past condition.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "She <span class=\"strong\">used to</span> give me advice when I was sad.<br/>She <span class=\"strong\">would</span> give me advice when I was sad.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">used to</span> be reckless when I was a child. <br/><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through;\">I would be reckless when I was a child.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, talk about what you used to do with your family when you were a child.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give as many details as you can.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask follow-up questions to keep the conversation going.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about past habits with my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give details about what I used to do with my family.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask follow-up questions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le12ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's my way or the highway? You'd better take that back, Marco. I never let other people tell me what to do like that. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: You're so touchy, V. Just take it easy. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm being perfectly reasonable. You ought to think before you speak, you know. My mother would say, \u201cIf you can't say anything nice, don't say anything at all.\u201d <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: My mother used to say that, too. You might want to hear yourself before you recklessly accuse me of being insensitive. You said my mother was strange!"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "31000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You have selective hearing, Marco. I meant her advice was strange ...<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Hmm ... you cleverly got out of that one, didn't you? What's this here? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's my antique sewing machine ... my grandmother used to use it. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: She would make clothes from this? Wow - it's ancient!"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob02re2img07.jpg", "time": "50300", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: There you go again - rudely saying whatever pops into your head!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Why is it in the kitchen, anyway? Shouldn't it be in a sewing room?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Does it look like I have a sewing room? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Honestly, I don't know ... you ought to give me a tour."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le12ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le12ob02re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 2}, {"templa